# Modal profile

For any Modal command in this repo (`modal run`, `modal app`, `modal volume`, `modal secret`, etc.), always use the **`nishkalhundia`** profile.

```bash
# ✅ GOOD
modal run --profile nishkalhundia --detach run_modal_prompted_sweep.py
MODAL_PROFILE=nishkalhundia modal app logs steering-prompted-sweep

# ❌ BAD — default / other profiles (e.g. swastik3)
modal run --detach run_modal_prompted_sweep.py
```

Also set `MODAL_PROFILE=nishkalhundia` in subprocess / script environments when spawning Modal jobs from this workspace.
